<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian meat exports down in May 97 - ABS.</title>
<headline>Australian meat exports down in May 97 - ABS.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian exports of fresh meat (tonnes) for May 1997 from the Australian Bureau of Statistics.</p>
<p>		   Beef	Veal	   Mutton	Lamb</p>
<p>		   Bone-in  Bone-in	 Bone-in     Bone-in</p>
<p> May	97   1,827     123	     7,863	5,326</p>
<p> April    97   2,878	87	     8,459	5,370</p>
<p> May	96   2,965     173	     6,392	3,961</p>
<p>		  Beef	 Veal	   Mutton	Lamb</p>
<p>		  Bone-out   Bone-out     Bone-out    Bone-out</p>
<p> May	97   69,900	309	   4,128	 549</p>
<p> April    97   69,039	321	   3,672	 825</p>
<p> May	96   56,505	377	   4,987	 855</p>
<p>NOTE: Previous month's figures have been revised.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
